    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39540" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικαίνῠμαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>surpass, excel</i> (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καίνυμαι</span>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντας ἐπ᾽
				ἀνθρώπους ἐκέκαστο</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄλβῳ τε πλούτῳ τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					24.535
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be adorned</i> or <i>furnished with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ φρεσὶ πευκαλίμῃσι κέκασται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.35
				</span></i>
			 (unless in signf.<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷς ἐπικαίνυται
			ἵππος</span> (cj. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικίνυται</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				12.145
			</span></i>.</div>
